# Credentials must never enter the build context, let alone an image layer --
# an image layer can be unpacked by anyone who pulls the image, and deleting a
# file in a later layer does not remove it from an earlier one it was already
# baked into. See CLAUDE.md "Repository hygiene" and task-7-brief.md.
.env
.env.*

.git
.gitignore
.github

node_modules
dist
data
coverage

docs
.superpowers
tests

tmp
temp
tmpprobe
*.log
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
